{
  "item": [
    {
      "id": "20dfd3c2-4643-4b71-978d-850cc6622c7d",
      "name": "Labels",
      "description": {
        "content": "Cabify offers to its clients a feature where the client’s employees have to input a journey motive or a project or a dynamic cost center associated with the new journey before requesting it. This is usually used for financial budgeting and reporting purposes since every journey now comes with this data linked to it, in other words, clients can segment their invoices by these Labels. <br> <br> Since some companies have a lot of Labels (projects/cost centers) that need to be managed they can use our API to do so. We allow creating, modifying, and disabling them directly from, for example, the client’s ERP (SAP, NetSuite, MSDynamics, etc.).",
        "type": "text/plain"
      },
      "item": [
